        <mxCell id="erd_quotation_qdok_txt" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;To be 09-11-2026&lt;/b&gt;: dokumen dari customer (PO, SPK, surat penunjukan, bukti bayar, dll.) &lt;b&gt;wajib&lt;/b&gt; diunggah saat Deal, minimal 1 file; tampil di detail quotation dan View Sales Order (QTN-FR-11, SO-FR-05). Pengunggah &amp;amp; waktu = kolom audit &lt;i&gt;created_by&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;created_date&lt;/i&gt;." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1128" y="960" width="364" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
